  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">iVAC2L-4-India</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Pulsecath B.V. has developed a technology (iAVC2L) that can support the circulation of heart patients undergoing high-risk treatments (percutaneous coronary intervention (PCI)).Pulsecath plans to demonstrate this technology with various Indian distributors and medical centers to demonstrate its superiority over conventional methods, such as the intra-aortic balloon pump (IABP).</narrative>
  </description>
